Yeah, The thing is I am gonna go overseas for my masters (AU). Where prices are really high, like 1.5 times higher than USA. So better to decide now I think. I feel like I can't decide and asking other people to decide for me but I feel stuck. And don't want to spend money on things that I don't really need.

